  "title": "QTurbo: A Robust and Efficient Compiler for Analog Quantum Simulation",
  "abstract": "Analog quantum simulation leverages native hardware dynamics to emulate complex quantum systems with great efficiency by bypassing the quantum circuit abstraction. However, conventional compilation methods for analog simulators are typically labor-intensive, prone to errors, and computationally demanding. This paper introduces QTurbo, a powerful analog quantum simulation compiler designed to significantly enhance compilation efficiency and optimize hardware execution time. By generating precise and noise-resilient pulse schedules, our approach ensures greater accuracy and reliability, outperforming the existing state-of-the-art approach.",
